  "question": {
    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math> are unit vectors such that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math>, then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is equal to :",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "7eaFR",
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "vxf8z",
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>15</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>16</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "rewk4",
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mn>15</mn></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>&nbsp;",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "6q7PF",
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mn>15</mn></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mn>16</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math></p><p>Squaring both sides,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>.</mo><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>&#952;</mi></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>15</mn></msqrt><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Now,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>15</mn></msqrt><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math></p>",
